### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Get all products (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?page=1&pageSize=10 HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### 2. Search products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?search=Mechanical HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get product by ID (seeded product)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/019488a0-0000-7000-8000-000000000001 HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### 4. Create new product
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "KB-WIRELESS-01",
  "name": "Wireless Mechanical Keyboard",
  "price": 149.99,
  "currency": "USD",
  "initialStock": 50
}

### 5. Restock product
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/019488a0-0000-7000-8000-000000000001/restock HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 25
}
